<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:40 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Phi-lê-môn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Phi-lê-môn</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phm</para>
  <para style="mt">Phi-lê-môn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Phao-lô, adro tu ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji adro oh ay Ti-mô-thê, atăq ka Phi-lê-môn, adro xung xiaq ji 'wơyq kung dơơp ku 'wot; <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ka Ap-bi, adro oh ay ku 'wot; ka A-chip, khơl 'wơyq kuun ku 'wot; ji ka tayuup vah aduq hnhư ku kơy. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Apôôy vôôch vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay ji Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, truh tol oh ay.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Gô hloay kuh kway Kơy Plêêk ku gô, tuôôy văch truh kơy đom apok apôôy ku gô, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />vii măn tameng truh xuum xung xiaq ku kơy kung dii xuum tuôq đơu kơy e đom Lôôk Jê-xu, ji deng ka dêq hloay khơl vah, <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />truh nôôy varơuq padoh hlê xuum tuôq ku kơy e hnoq wih jêêk e đom varơuq nhonq xet truh tôôy varơuq kaxay tamaq wih truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn katul haay. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Neq adro oh ay, gô heq e 'ngưng hlah hlaak ji varơuq hlơq hlôôp vii kơq xuum xung xiaq ku kơy, xing xuum klaak ku khơl vah heq jah dơơp đơơu gamưh kơy.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Jo anưq, ju e 'ngưng varơuq kôk kalh đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh xôq vlôh tanưưl ka kơy truh varơuq duh pheq dơơp, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />bơh vii xuum xung xiaq, gô đnooy vlôh apok apôôy vôôch yôôych iaq — tuôôy laa muuyq adro đaji Phao-lô neq, muuyq kơy karaq, đơu juneq kung laa adro tu vii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu — <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Gô apôôy xiin kơy xaloah ka adro koot ku gô, adro đơu gô heq pahleh vlôh đom varơuq talơy looy tooy ku gô, laa Ô-nê-sim. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Adroyq neq, ay nưq be ich kajoq ka kơy, bơh juneq yôôych ich lơơy kaah ka kơy, hloay ka gô, <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />'ngưq laa adro đơu gô patăk wiit xuq tavơh kơy — kadih ay nưq — adro neq laa xuum klaak ku gô. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Gô xung trôôch jư ay nưq hlê dii gô, xôq ay nưq e hnoq xaloah kơy waak varơuq ka gô katul kaluh talơy looy tooy vii kơq Hêêl Kaxay. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ju anưq, gô leh trôôch dơơp varơuq kajoq đơu leh e varơuq ưng chiuq ku kơy, xôq varơuq tolh ku kơy be aalq dang đaji laa vii eep dăt, bơh bơyh xuum ưng kadih. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Leh kheoq vii liq jo neq đơu ay nưq heq biq aklah xangưưy dii kơy đom muuyq kawat, xôq ka kơy hnoq ik nhonq hlê ay nưq miet miet, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />leh măn đaji xapok đnoyq, bơh kôt yơơt iaq muuyq xapok — muuyq adro oh ay xung xiaq, dong dik đôôyq dii gô, đơu laay kang iaq đnoyq đôôyq dii kơy, kaah đom xăk xamơk hloay đom Lôôk. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Jo anưq, atoh kơy 'yo gô laa 'wơyq kung dơơp, xiin nhonq ay nưq đaji hnoq nhonq gô. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Măn atoh ay nưq heq dơơp ra ơơh kơy long măk lôôkq kơy paq kê varơuq kajoq, yôôych dayh jauq varơuq nưq ka gô. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Gô, Phao-lô, heq valơk apok neq bơơn kadih ti gô: kadih gô hnoq bla hlê — xôq leh aalq đnooy dii kơy đaneq kơy pheq đnooy măk lôôkq gô kadih xăk kơy! <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Jơq, adro oh ay, apôôy gô nhonq jah ich lơơy xing aduq kơy đom Lôôk; xiin kơy dayh dơơp đơơu xuum klaak ku gô đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Vii tuôq kajưk muut varơuq tameng apok ku kơy, lunưq gô heq valơk thư ka kơy, xet đaneq kơy hnoq dưk dơơp pheq đnooy măn iaq kaah varơuq gô đong padoh vlôh. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Ka tuôôy, kung xiin ralauq palauq muuyq aduq măn ka gô, vii gô takôô gamưh đaneq gamưh apok apôôy ku oh ay, gô hnoq jah tha xuq dii oh ay.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Ê-phap-ra, adro raa tu dii gô đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, vôôch hlơq kơy. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Maak, A-ri-tak, Đê-ma, ji Lu-ka, khơl 'wơyq kung dơơp ku gô, kung vôôch hlơq kơy.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu măn dii danưng kooy oh ay. Amen!<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>